msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "JAGS"
msgstr "JAGS"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid ""
"Implement Bayesian graphical models with Martyn Plummer’s JAGS program for "
"Markov chain Monte Carlo"
msgstr ""
"使用 Martyn Plummer 開發之 JAGS 程式進行馬可夫鏈蒙地卡羅，以實現貝氏圖形模型"

